"Narcissus House, on Watergarden Road in Apex, is the Velra family mansion."
"Its gate opens to a phone and handprint; Avowed Velras open it by interface command."
"Planters of pale hellebore and off-world red tendril plants glow when the wind stirs them."
"A curving staircase descends into the White Parlor, with white pillows and a stone fireplace."
"Aulia's office holds four globes, of Earth and each Artona, and is shielded like a panic room."
"A walk-in dressing room with pink velvet armchairs joins Aulia's and Jessica's bedrooms."
"Its panic protocols make the whole house effectively a bomb shelter."
"It has a huge marble-island kitchen, a formal living room with a piano, and a helipad."
"A sunroom and outdoor kitchen open off the house."
"Some Velra relatives move into the mansion whenever it stands empty."
"The Velra mansion flooded in the Matadero disaster."
